      "surface": "鎮北竟陵王功曹史",
      "quote": "鎮北竟陵王功曹史",
      "work_and_volume": "南齊書卷四十",
      "parallel_source": "source-evidence/liang021-wangzhi/external/nanqishu040-ws2272748.wikitext",
      "revision": 2272748,
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2272748",
      "sha256": "5ee4445da47c28466a6c227f23c2aac3a6941a84d4e2131a050011f70e30e7ff",
      "first_line": 26,
      "last_line": 26,
      "start_codepoint": 18,
      "end_codepoint": 61,
      "primary_quote": "世祖卽位，封竟陵郡王，邑二千戶。爲使持節、都督南徐兖二州諸軍事、鎮北將軍、南徐州刺史。",
      "interpretation": "世祖即位，子良封竟陵而任鎮北。永明元年改征北。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 22,
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p002",
      "start": 115,
      "end": 122,
      "surface": "安陸南郡二王友",
      "quote": "安陸南郡二王友",
      "work_and_volume": "南齊書卷三",
      "parallel_source": "source-evidence/liang021-wangzhi/external/ws2312008.wikitext",
      "revision": 2312008,
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2312008",
      "sha256": "5b1fac37e3721143a6e72eb508ed9df94804678ec11ddd83e7568d637f02db8b",
      "first_line": 25,
      "last_line": 25,
      "start_codepoint": 96,
      "end_codepoint": 144,
      "primary_quote": "應城公子敬為安陸王，江陵公子懋為晉安王，枝江公子隆為隨郡王，皇子子真為建安王，皇孫昭業為南郡王。",
      "interpretation": "世祖即位之詔同封子敬與昭業；同段王志為鎮北竟陵王功曹史。高帝所封南郡王長懋另有其人。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 26,
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p004",
      "start": 192,
      "end": 199,
      "surface": "安西始興王長史",
      "quote": "安西始興王長史",
      "work_and_volume": "梁書卷二十二",
      "parallel_source": "source-evidence/liang021-wangzhi/external/liangshu022-ws1513347.wikitext",
      "revision": 1513347,
      "permalink": "https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1513347",
      "sha256": "94e38a83a5c49d47cb4a42f5036f55883e3afecdb214256ab9ee333cc69d3f1a",
      "first_line": 88,
      "last_line": 88,
      "start_codepoint": 153,
      "end_codepoint": 177,
      "primary_quote": "天監元年，加安西將軍，都督、刺史如故。封始興郡王",
      "interpretation": "鄰傳作嶦，六年水災敘內亦出憺字，保留各處字形。"
    },
    {
      "source_line": 26,
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-021-wangzhi:p004",
      "start": 214,
      "end": 222,
      "surface": "平西鄱陽郡王長史",
      "quote": "平西鄱陽郡王長史",
      "work_and_volume": "梁書卷二十二",
